WEBVTT

00:00:00.394 --> 00:00:07.327
You ask the agent to read your mail. It cannot yet, because you have not signed in to your mail service, and it tells you so.

00:00:07.996 --> 00:00:13.436
Open Connections in the settings menu. Mail is listed as not connected. Choose Connect.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:17.638
Your mail provider asks whether to allow access. You allow it.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:28.028
That is all. Back in the chat, mail shows as connected. The agent now acts as you, and your tokens are sealed in the database, never shown to the model.
